WEBVTT

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:04.049
This is AccountSignal, an open-source app built on Olostep.

00:00:04.049 --> 00:00:08.989
You upload a list of companies, and it tells you which accounts to contact first, and why now.

00:00:09.787 --> 00:00:17.849
First, define your ideal customer: industries, locations, company size, tech stack, funding stage, and hiring.

00:00:17.849 --> 00:00:20.386
Every account is scored against this profile.

00:00:21.192 --> 00:00:24.735
Next, upload a CSV with company names and domains.

00:00:24.735 --> 00:00:28.209
Contact emails are optional, and they never leave your server.

00:00:29.021 --> 00:00:37.516
AccountSignal detects the columns automatically, validates every row, groups duplicates, and shows exactly which companies will be researched.

00:00:38.648 --> 00:00:41.326
Before anything is spent, you see the cost.

00:00:41.326 --> 00:00:46.350
About twenty Olostep credits of research per company, plus a few for evidence checks.

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:49.174
Without an API key, you can still try the demo.

00:00:49.979 --> 00:00:51.034
Let's run the demo.

00:00:51.034 --> 00:00:54.352
For each company, Olostep Answers does the research.

00:00:54.352 --> 00:00:58.715
Then Search and Scrape open each buying signal's source, to check it is real.

00:00:58.715 --> 00:01:02.873
Finally, it scores ICP fit and timing, and writes a brief.

00:01:03.663 --> 00:01:08.889
Accounts are ranked into four groups: Act now, Nurture, Watch, and Skip.

00:01:08.889 --> 00:01:14.165
The priority matrix plots fit against timing, and the board shows who to contact first.

00:01:14.971 --> 00:01:20.930
Open any account to see its brief: why it fits, why now, the gaps, and what to check next.

00:01:20.930 --> 00:01:25.834
Every signal shows its date, its source, and whether the evidence was verified.

00:01:26.639 --> 00:01:29.714
Export everything as CSV or JSON.

00:01:29.714 --> 00:01:35.254
Try the demo with no API key, or add your Olostep key to analyse real companies.

00:01:35.254 --> 00:01:37.045
Olostep does the research.

00:01:37.045 --> 00:01:39.149
AccountSignal makes the decision.
